							{
								"box": {
									"code": "// codebox_spec.gen -- f_ks stage 3: the spectral step. Multiplies every bin of u-hat by\n// exp((K2 - K2^2) * dt) with K = 2*pi*m/L, and zeroes the k = 0 bin. 256x256 float32.\n// Mirror: tests/modules/ks/ks_mirror.spec_stage().\n//\n// Input in1 = spectral texture (R,G = Re,Im of u-hat). Output R,G = Re,Im; B,A = 0.\n//   - dt is the EFFECTIVE per-frame dt, already clamped in the patcher (FR-006); the same value\n//     goes to the nl stage. L is the domain size (DX = L / N).\n//   - the k = 0 (DC) bin is zeroed every frame and is not a toggle (FR-005): without it the mean\n//     drifts downward (spec Clarifications)\n//   - signed bin index from floor(norm * N), not `cell`; the upper half maps to index - N, so the\n//     Nyquist bin is -N/2 (the rate K2 - K2^2 is even in the index, so the sign is immaterial)\n//   - unary minus before a parenthesis mis-parses in GenExpr; none is used here\nParam dt(0.05);\nParam L(50);\n\nN = 256;\nbx = floor(norm.x * N);\nby = floor(norm.y * N);\nmx = switch(bx < N * 0.5, bx, bx - N);\nmy = switch(by < N * 0.5, by, by - N);\nkx = twopi / L * mx;\nky = twopi / L * my;\nk2 = kx * kx + ky * ky;\ngr = k2 * (1 - k2);\ng = exp(gr * dt);\ndc = (1 - step(0.5, bx)) * (1 - step(0.5, by));\ng = g * (1 - dc);\n\nout1 = vec(nearest(in1, norm).x * g, nearest(in1, norm).y * g, 0, 0);\n",
